# Allow-list: excluding everything first keeps new repo-root files (docs, dev
# tooling, local databases and their WAL sidecars) out of the build context
# automatically, instead of needing an entry here before they invalidate layers.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src/
# Compile-time inputs: sqlx::migrate!() embeds migrations/, query macros read .sqlx/.
!migrations/
!.sqlx/
